{"title": "Netheril", "pageid": 20515, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Netheril", "categories": ["Lore"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Netheril</b> was an ancient human magocracy until its fall 1831 years before the events of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Netherese arcanists were powerful enough to create flying enclaves — remarkable floating cities. Their empire was lost in the event that is now known as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus%27s_Folly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus' Folly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus%27s_Folly\">Karsus' Folly</a></span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Karsus.27s_Folly\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Karsus's_Folly\">Karsus's Folly</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/105px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/140px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Karsus was perhaps the most powerful wizard that ever lived.... Imagine what it must have felt like. To be a god. To know yourself to be untouchable. To be mistaken.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>, on Karsus' folly</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p>A young and powerful Netherese mage named <b>Karsus</b> felt that it was his duty to return the Netherese Empire to its former glory, so he tried to steal power from a god to become a god himself. As his target he chose Mystryl, who was the Goddess of Magic at that time. He designed a spell named <i>Karsus's avatar</i> that would allow him to steal Mystryl's divinity. Immediately after he cast the spell, he was overwhelmed with the divine power he received and realized his fatal mistake: he stole magic from the one god he shouldn't have.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>When Mystryl lost her ability to keep the Weave intact, magic became unstable. To save the Weave, Mystryl sacrificed herself before the damage became irreparable. This broke Karsus’s link to her magic and obstructed the Weave, causing all magic to briefly cease functioning. Without magic, the floating cities of Netheril fell — along with Karsus himself, who died knowing he had destroyed his beloved empire and killed everyone he ever loved. \n</p><p>Mystryl later reincarnated as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/30px-Mystra_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/40px-Mystra_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp/20px-Mystra_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Mystra_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a>, the new goddess of magic. In an effort to prevent similar abuses of magic in the future, Mystra imposed various restrictions on mortals' use of magic, including banning magic beyond 9th level outright and limiting the number of lower-level spells that spellcasters could have access to at a time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Netherese_Orb\">Netherese Orb</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>, longing to impress Mystra, begged her to give him access to forbidden levels of magic, which she repeatedly refused. He sought out a tome containing a scrap of Netherese Weave, hoping to impress his goddess by returning it to her. However, when he opened the book, something shot from the book into his chest, and his body became an unwitting host to an extremely destructive Netherese orb. To keep the orb inhabiting and corrupting his body in check, Gale must continually sate it with powerful magical artefacts; if he fails, the orb will detonate, bearing enough destructive power to bring down even whole cities, and Gale with them. As a punishment for his hubris, Gale lost his position as Chosen, and Mystra ceased contact with him.\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/105px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/140px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Now, so many centuries later, I tried to follow in the footsteps of Karsus, not to destroy Mystra, but to prove my love for her. I tried to control only a fraction of magic that was unleashed that day. I merely sought to return one tiny diamond to an imperfect crown. Gale's Folly one might call it.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>, on his own mistake</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legacy\">Legacy</span></h2>\n<p>The world is filled with ancient ruins of fallen Netherese cities. Surviving Netherese magic items are extremely powerful and valuable, as they were created in a period when magic was at its highest, before Mystra's restrictions.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> resembles the technologies the Netherese once had, and the books on its shelves suggest <a href=\"/wiki/Lenore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lenore\">Lenore</a> studied them when she created that tower.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Thultanthar_and_Shadovar\">Thultanthar and Shadovar</span></h3>\n<p>One of the enclaves, Thultanthar, survived. After a thousand years in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfell\" title=\"Shadowfell\">Shadowfell</a> it became known as The City of Shade. Most of its residents became shades, and they colloquially known as Shadovar, with an affinity for Shadow Magic.\n</p><p>These shades sought to create a new Netheril in their image. Five years prior to the events of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>, the archwizard <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Elminster.png/25px-Portrait_Elminster.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Elminster.png/38px-Portrait_Elminster.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Elminster.png/50px-Portrait_Elminster.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elminster Aumar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Elminster.png/25px-Portrait_Elminster.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Elminster.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster Aumar</a> fought Thultanthar in a climactic battle above Myth Drannor. It fell upon Myth Drannor, destroying both cities.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Related_spells.2C_items.2C_creatures\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_spells,_items,_creatures\">Related spells, items, creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spells\">Spells</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/38px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/50px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus' Compulsion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\">Karsus' Compulsion</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherese_Orb_Blast\" title=\"Netherese Orb Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Netherese Orb Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Netherese_Orb_Blast\" title=\"Netherese Orb Blast\">Netherese Orb Blast</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/21px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/32px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/43px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crown of Karsus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png/21px-Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Crown_of_Karsus_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">Crown of Karsus</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet\" title=\"Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Studded_Gauntlet\" title=\"Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet\">Netherstone-Studded Gauntlet</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\">Triune Netherstone</a></span> - built from:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gortash%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Gortash's Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Gortash%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gortash%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Gortash's Netherstone\">Gortash's Netherstone</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Ketheric's Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Ketheric's Netherstone\">Ketheric's Netherstone</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Orin's Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Ico