 Karsus\">Ye Follye of Karsus</a></span> references Karsus and the Crown</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> has a Netherese Orb in his chest; he can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherese_Orb_Blast\" title=\"Netherese Orb Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Netherese Orb Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Netherese_Orb_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Netherese_Orb_Blast\" title=\"Netherese Orb Blast\">Netherese Orb Blast</a> to end the game early</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span cl